stance: Desert planets will spawn as salt desert, basalt desert or brine sea planets - or as normal desert, using one of the alternate \"desert\" textures included in the mod. This applies to most planet types.<br><br>The mod <b>does not increase the amount of planets</b>, and does not* change any existing planets. It is purely visual.<br><span class=\"size-small\">*except for two types.</span></div></td></tr></tbody></table></div></div><br><div class=\"align-center\"><img src=\"https://media3.giphy.com/media/v1.Y2lkPTc5MGI3NjExOWpoN3o2eGJ5amZqNTMwamxmeWJsNzNlc29keHFxanViYWtkb3gybyZlcD12MV9pbnRlcm5hbF9naWZfYnlfaWQmY3Q9Zw/bCwwnmBeP6ktMzkih0/giphy.gif%5Dhttps://media3.giphy.com/media/v1.Y2lkPTc5MGI3NjExOWpoN3o2eGJ5amZqNTMwamxmeWJsNzNlc29keHFxanViYWtkb3gybyZlcD12MV9pbnRlcm5hbF9naWZfYnlfaWQmY3Q9Zw/bCwwnmBeP6ktMzkih0/giphy.gif\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\"><br><hr><details class=\"spoiler\"><summary>Image Examples</summary><div class=\"table-scroll\"><table><tbody><tr><td><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/wsCG60d/PLANET-SHOWCASE-2c.png\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\"></td></tr></tbody></table></div><span class=\"size-bigger\"><b>And more!</b></span><br>The original textures used can be found <a href=\"https://fractalsoftworks.com/forum/index.php?topic=31082\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\">here</a></details></div><hr><details class=\"spoiler\"><summary>Change Log</summary><a href=\"https://github.com/SirHartley/Kaleidoscope/releases/\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\">Link to GitHub</a></details><details class=\"spoiler\"><summary>Attribution / Acknowledgement</summary><div class=\"table-scroll\"><table><tbody><tr><td><b>pixel_rice_bowl</b></td><td>      </td><td>Made the planet textures and provided them to the community.</td></tr><tr><td><b>Lukas04</b></td><td>      </td><td>Helped with obfuscated code.</td></tr></tbody></table></div></details><details class=